<!--
    The themed-icon layer (Android 13+): the same traced mark as
    ic_launcher_foreground, in one colour, which the launcher replaces with the
    wallpaper-derived tint.

    Only alpha survives theming, so the two parts of the mark are told apart by
    opacity rather than by hue - the F solid, the fold at 60% - which keeps the
    fold legible as a separate shape instead of merging into one silhouette.
-->
